A cyberpunk scene of a lone figure sitting at a glowing holographic workstation in a rain-soaked neon-lit alley, surrounded by floating translucent data panels showing interconnected nodes and workflow diagrams. The figure works intensely while ghostly sync progress bars pulse in the humid air around them. Towering Asian-inspired megastructures loom in the background with flickering advertisements. Multiple holographic threads connect the worker to distant glowing avatars of team members scattered across the cityscape like constellations. The atmosphere is moody with purple and cyan lighting reflecting off wet pavement, conveying both the chaos of managing many tasks and the satisfaction of organized productivity despite an unreliable, fragmented digital environment.
